    rdfs:label "Diprotodont Incisors, Wide Diastema, and Selenodont Shearing Molars"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Three pairs of upper incisors, single procumbent pair of lower incisors for leaf-nipping, wide post-incisor diastema, and four crescent-ridged (selenodont) molars per quadrant for fine shearing of fibrous eucalypt leaves."@en .

